.TH "PIP-SHOW" "1" "Aug 05, 2026" "26.2" "pip"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pip-show \- description of pip show command
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Show information about one or more installed packages.
.sp
The output is in RFC\-compliant mail header format.

.SH "نحوه استفاده (USAGE)"
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
python \-m pip show [options] <package> ...
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-f, \-\-files
Show the full list of installed files for each package.
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_FILES\fP)
.UNINDENT

.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
pip developers
